{"id":4328,"date":"2024-09-10T13:06:30","date_gmt":"2024-09-10T12:06:30","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/?p=4328"},"modified":"2024-12-10T12:23:16","modified_gmt":"2024-12-10T12:23:16","slug":"ccac-young-designer-award-winner-polly-north-joins-the-bemrose-school-in-derby","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/ccac-young-designer-award-winner-polly-north-joins-the-bemrose-school-in-derby\/","title":{"rendered":"CCAC Young Designer Award winner, Polly North, joins The Bemrose School in Derby"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1080\" height=\"720\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/profile.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4329 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/profile.jpg 1080w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/profile-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/profile-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/profile-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/profile-188x125.jpg 188w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1080px) 100vw, 1080px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1080px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1080\/720;\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>We are delighted that interior architect Polly North has earned one of CCAC\u2019s Young Designer awards.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Polly\u2019s work is rooted in sustainable building, with a focus on retrofit and renovation. Her practice \u2013 LANDE Design Studio &#8211; focuses on low tech and natural methods of construction in a bid to lower the carbon footprint associated with the construction sector.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Polly grew up in South Wales, where she was introduced to the discipline of house-building at an early age. Her father built their family farm over the course of seven years, with help from Polly and her three siblings.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u201cIt gave me an understanding of how much energy is required to build and to live in the modern world,\u201d says Polly. \u201cThe modern, western world has become accustomed to consumption and excess. I\u2019m interested in distinguishing between what we \u2018want\u2019 and what we \u2018need\u2019 in a bid to reduce our environmental impact\u201d<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1957\" height=\"1448\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/extending-a-shed-on-the-farm-aged-11.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4331 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/extending-a-shed-on-the-farm-aged-11.png 1957w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/extending-a-shed-on-the-farm-aged-11-300x222.png 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/extending-a-shed-on-the-farm-aged-11-1024x758.png 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/extending-a-shed-on-the-farm-aged-11-768x568.png 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/extending-a-shed-on-the-farm-aged-11-1536x1136.png 1536w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/extending-a-shed-on-the-farm-aged-11-270x200.png 270w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/extending-a-shed-on-the-farm-aged-11-169x125.png 169w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1957px) 100vw, 1957px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1957px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1957\/1448;\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><em>Polly clears the site for the family farm<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">LANDE\u2019s first project was underpinned by this ethos &#8211; remodelling an old stone building for a Zero Waste shop in Cheshire to increase energy efficiency and create a beautiful space using only salvaged, natural and 100% recycled materials.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Polly also has a background in education. Since graduating from Northumbria University in 2016, she has run workshops across Europe and is now a tutor at Manchester School of Architecture.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1080\" height=\"725\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/thumbnail_edited-3.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4330 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/thumbnail_edited-3.jpg 1080w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/thumbnail_edited-3-300x201.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/thumbnail_edited-3-1024x687.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/thumbnail_edited-3-768x516.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/thumbnail_edited-3-298x200.jpg 298w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/thumbnail_edited-3-186x125.jpg 186w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1080px) 100vw, 1080px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1080px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1080\/725;\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><em>A Lande Studio retrofit and redesign of a zero-waste shop in Cheshire<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u201cI love teaching at university and I\u2019m really excited to be working with 9 and 10 year olds. Children have a bold imagination that isn\u2019t compromised by concern about what other people might think. This creates a really exciting environment and I\u2019m looking forward to being a part of the education of these future adults.\u201d<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Polly will be working with The Bemrose School in Derby on a co-design centred around sustainable building. During their extended 6-week project, the children will learn more about mycelium, an organism which can be used for insulation, acoustic panelling and even bricks, whilst also remaining 100% compostable and carbon positive.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>The CCAC Young Designer Award is supported by The Linbury Trust<\/strong>. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"434\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Linbury-colour-1024x434.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4108 lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/434;width:151px;height:auto\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Linbury-colour-1024x434.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Linbury-colour-300x127.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Linbury-colour-768x325.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Linbury-colour-1536x651.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Linbury-colour-2048x867.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Linbury-colour-360x152.jpg 360w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Linbury-colour-200x85.jpg 200w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We are delighted that interior architect Polly North 